        "retrieval_text": "Embry may experience Kai as a trusted practical guide whose cautions help her convert independence into competent restraint rather than impulsive defiance. Embry may want Kai's presence to legitimize a risky act of autonomy: skipping obligations becomes emotionally safer when paired with Kai's etiquette-based warning and shared surf competence. Embry's dream may be uncertain about whether Kai is fully available as a stable relational anchor, since the identity continuity could not be confirmed while Kai's speaking role is only marked in a limited time window. Embry may be rehearsing a stance in which accepting correction from Kai does not diminish her agency; Kai's warning about cutting across the lineup functions as a boundary cue Embry can choose to honor.",
